@{
    ViewData["Title"] = "About";
}

<div class="editorial editorial--narrow">
    <header class="editorial-head">
        <div class="ohrbob-logo ohrbob-logo-left about-logo">
            <span class="ohrbob-logo-icon"><img src="~/images/ohrbob-logo.svg" alt="ohrbob" /></span>
            <span class="ohrbob-logo-text">
                <span class="char-1">o</span><span class="char-2">h</span><span class="char-3">r</span><span class="char-4">b</span><span class="char-5">o</span><span class="char-6">b</span>
            </span>
        </div>
        <p class="metro-kicker">our story</p>
        <h1 class="metro-title metro-title--compact">The Story Behind Ohrbob</h1>
        <p class="editorial-lede">Hi, I'm Kai. I created Ohrbob out of a very personal need: I wanted a way for my daughters to listen to podcasts that was safe, reliable, and completely trustworthy.</p>
    </header>

    <section class="editorial-section editorial-prose">
        <p>In today's fast-paced digital world, most podcast platforms are built around keeping you glued to the screen, pushing endless recommendations, and harvesting your data. I didn't want that for my family. I needed a system where I could curate the content, organize it into easily accessible "stations", and let them just press play—knowing exactly what they were listening to.</p>

        <p>That simple idea grew into Ohrbob. It became a powerful tool to manage feeds, track listening progress across devices, and organize audio exactly the way we wanted.</p>

        <p>But beyond my own family, I built this to give something back. I firmly believe in the power of open-source software and the amazing community around it. Ohrbob is fully open-source and self-hostable because you shouldn't have to trade your privacy for a great listening experience. You have the right to own your data, run your own server, and enjoy your podcasts on your own terms.</p>
    </section>

    <section class="editorial-section about-thanks">
        <p class="about-thanks__line">Thank you for being part of this journey.</p>
        <div class="about-actions">
            <a asp-controller="Home" asp-action="Index" class="editorial-action">Start listening</a>
            <a href="https://github.com/ohrbob-org/" target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="editorial-action editorial-action--ghost"><i class="bi bi-github" aria-hidden="true"></i> GitHub</a>
        </div>
    </section>
</div>
